# rithmic-research-sync.timer — every 4 hours (00/04/08/12/16/20 Cyprus). History: hourly (30 Sep) spent the
# 5-hour Claude session limit in ~90 min; every 2 h at 50 calls/h spent the WEEKLY limit in ~21 h. Since
# 2026-10-01 (founder: mix models + slower): routine agents on Sonnet, judgment (SKEPTIC, STEER, BRIEF, HERMES,
# CURATOR) on Opus, two researchers per cycle alternating. Fires at :00 (replay last cycle's RESEARCHER
# proposals, sync, export); the StarNet jobs follow at :02 FILLS, :05 QUANT, :15 PROPDESK, :27 SKEPTIC,
# :40 STEER, :48/:54 the cycle's two researchers. Persistent: a missed cycle is harmless late.
[Unit]
Description=Every-4h StarNet desk cycle (replay + sync + export)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 00/4:00:00 Asia/Nicosia
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
